OL,3,GNEWSAHolywell cliff fall caused by
OL,4,A'fault in rocks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA beach cave collapsed due a "fault in
OL,7,Fthe rocks", a geologist has said.
OL,9,FThe collapse at the historical landmark
OL,10,FHolywell cave in Holywell Bay, Newquay,
OL,11,Fis thought to have occurred overnight
OL,12,Fon Saturday.
OL,14,FThe cave, also known as St Cuthbert's
OL,15,FCave, on the southern cliffs of Kelsey
OL,16,FHead featured in the BBC's Poldark
OL,17,Fseries and was known for its
OL,18,Fmulti-coloured rocks.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
