OL,3,GNEWSAHolywell cliff fall caused by
OL,4,A'fault in rocks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeologist Paul Foster described the
OL,7,Ffault as "a double-edged sword" since
OL,8,Fit had caused the colourful rocks but
OL,9,Fhad ultimately led to the cave's
OL,10,Fcollapse, which he warned may not be
OL,11,Fover.
